{"spread": 6, "blocks": [[{"t": "Editor\u2019s letter", "font": "Roboto-Bold", "size": 22.7, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 55, 197, 85]}], [{"t": "Azryl Ali", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Bold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 94, 124, 117]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [124, 102, 127, 116]}, {"t": "Editor of MINDMEP\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 114, 154, 128]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 126, 65, 140]}, {"t": "Dear readers,\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 138, 128, 152]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 150, 65, 164]}, {"t": "Welcome to the very first issue of ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 162, 228, 176]}, {"t": "MINDMEP. The name emerged as we ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 174, 235, 188]}, {"t": "turned a simple capability statement ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 186, 244, 200]}, {"t": "into a magazine: we mapped the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 198, 221, 212]}, {"t": "threads between projects, people and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 210, 250, 224]}, {"t": "ideas like a mind map, then paired it ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 222, 237, 236]}, {"t": "with our core discipline, MEP. MINDMEP ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 234, 251, 248]}, {"t": "connects how we think with what we ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 246, 244, 260]}, {"t": "build.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 258, 89, 272]}], [{"t": "We also designed it to look fabulous ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 282, 240, 296]}, {"t": "on a coffee table. The A5 format sits ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 294, 240, 308]}, {"t": "neatly in reception or the living room, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 306, 245, 320]}, {"t": "quiet yet bold, ready to be picked up ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 318, 244, 332]}, {"t": "and talked about.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 330, 150, 344]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 342, 65, 356]}, {"t": "On our cover, we spotlight one of the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 354, 243, 368]}, {"t": "heritage buildings Mint is currently ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 366, 234, 380]}, {"t": "working on, a project that embodies ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 378, 239, 392]}, {"t": "the delicate balance between ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 390, 209, 404]}, {"t": "preserving history and enabling ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 402, 218, 416]}, {"t": "modern function. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 414, 149, 428]}], [{"t": "In our feature article, Old Bones, New ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 217, 455, 231]}, {"t": "Beats, we take you inside Mint\u2019s ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 229, 432, 243]}, {"t": "growing capability in conservation ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 241, 445, 255]}, {"t": "engineering and the unique challenges ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 253, 466, 267]}, {"t": "of working within Singapore\u2019s heritage ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 265, 463, 279]}, {"t": "landscape.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 277, 328, 291]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 289, 278, 303]}, {"t": "This issue also introduces several key ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 301, 458, 315]}, {"t": "leaders who have recently stepped ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 313, 447, 327]}, {"t": "into new roles: Shan Nathan, General ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 325, 453, 339]}, {"t": "Manager for Singapore and Malaysia; ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 337, 456, 351]}, {"t": "Nuno, who now leads in Thailand; and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 349, 457, 363]}, {"t": "Jaymee Recto, our newly appointed ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 361, 451, 375]}, {"t": "Commercial Director. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 373, 376, 387]}], [{"t": "Each brings fresh energy and expertise ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 397, 467, 411]}, {"t": "to Mint\u2019s journey as we continue to ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 409, 448, 423]}, {"t": "grow across the region.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 421, 389, 435]}], [{"t": "For me personally, it has been a joy ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 217, 660, 231]}, {"t": "working alongside Mint Building ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 229, 644, 243]}, {"t": "Services and Mark Donlon over the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 241, 657, 255]}, {"t": "past two years.  This magazine is ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 253, 648, 267]}, {"t": "just another expression of that ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 265, 641, 279]}, {"t": "shared commitment to excellence, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 277, 657, 291]}, {"t": "collaboration, and telling the stories ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 289, 665, 303]}, {"t": "behind the work.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 301, 569, 315]}], [{"t": "Thank you for reading this debut issue. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 325, 679, 339]}, {"t": "I hope you find it as engaging and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 337, 655, 351]}, {"t": "inspiring to explore as it has been to ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 349, 666, 363]}, {"t": "put together.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 361, 552, 375]}], [{"t": "Azryl Ali\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [640, 385, 680, 399]}, {"t": "Marketing Lead", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [603, 397, 677, 411]}, {"t": "azryl@mi